From: CESAR MANUEL CARDENAS TORRES <al602874@academ01.mty.itesm.mx>

                                 PSYCHOTRON
                                     by
                                  MEGADETH
                               
                          COUNTDOWN TO EXTINCTION




   Key Notation
   h - hammer-on
   p - pull-off
   / or \ - slide
   b - bend
   PM - palm muting


  About 1 month ago i found out about this tablatures and started to copy
  some of them and i want to put in some songs in there. This is my first
  tablature that i do. I hope you can understand it. If you can play the 
  guitar solos exactly as it sound in the record, you must be a pro. If
  you have any suggestion send me a message.
  My e-mail address is: al602874@academ03.mty.itesm.mx
  My name is Cesar Cardenas
  Also if you have something from Marty Friedman or Jason Becker or Cacophony,
  please send it to me or to the place you find this tablature.


